WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Open the group on the left. Your private messages stay beside its channels.

00:03.500 --> 00:08.000
Open Group appearance from Group actions, choose a theme and save it.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Click a friend on the left. Your direct conversation uses your personal theme.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.250
Click the group icon to return to the channel you were reading.
